  "body": "Investigate the remaining SDK3 original-RGB repeatability failure at seed20261110/left_right,step7. The legacy raw observer retains only six steps. This adds a separate full12CPU-reference observer and minimal opt-in factory/CLI dispatch while preserving the legacy six-step observer and uninstrumented default.\n\nThe pinned diagnostic will execute one uninstrumented control pair and one full-RGB pair on separate hosted runners,with the same image/SDK/model/ORT/resource profile. All48probe source images are authenticated to their actual original model-source hashes and compared exactly after the episodes. No extra GPU readback/render/task tick or input mutation; CPU retention may alter timing. Equality is nondiscriminating and never promotes the retained original3/4FAIL orStage7.\n\nValidation so far:42focused tests pass,including late-step exact pixel location,malformed raw/manifests,option propagation and15negative lifecycle/identity mutations;actionlint passes. Exact sourceCI and one fresh review are required before actual activation. Actual diagnostics are NOT_RUN. No main merge,environment/registry publication,SDK rebuild,model weights inGit or altered historical requests/verdicts.",
